  m_Name: MCQ_003
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MCQQuestionData
  questionText: What is the nature of the substance added during the formation of
    potash alum to avoid the hydrolysis of Al<sup>3+</sup> ions?
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: An acidic substance, dilute H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub>, is added
    during the formation of potash alum to suppress the hydrolysis of Al<sup>3+</sup>
    ions.
  options:
  - Basic
  - Acidic
  - Neutral
  - None of the above
  correctOptionIndex: 1
